                                         DE1-SHIP-DATE-E
                                         DE1-SHIP-DATE-L
                                         DE1-SHIP-DATE-E-L
041700     ELSE
041800         MOVE PO-SHIP-DATE TO DATE-VALIDATE-IN
041900         CALL "TDATECK2" USING DATE-CHECK-AREA, LANGUAGE-PARMS
042000         MOVE DATE-SLASH-OUT   TO  DE1-SHIP-DATE
                                         DE1-SHIP-DATE-E
                                         DE1-SHIP-DATE-L
                                         DE1-SHIP-DATE-E-L.
042100
